    {
      "v": 9,
      "zh": "你要说，主耶和华如此说：这葡萄树岂能发旺呢？鹰岂不拔出它的根来，芟除它的果子，使它枯干，使它发的嫩叶都枯干了吗？也不用大力和多民，就拔出它的根来。",
      "en": "“Say to them: ‘This is what the Sovereign Lord says: “‘Will it prosper? Will he not rip out its rootsand cause its fruit to rot[NOTE:1] and wither?All its foliage[NOTE:2] will wither. No strong arm or large armywill be needed to pull it out by its roots.[NOTE:3]",
      "notes": [
        "The Hebrew root occurs only here in the OT and appears to have the meaning of “strip off.” In application to fruit the meaning may be “cause to rot.”",
        "Heb “all the טַרְפֵּי (tarpe) of branches.” The word טַרְפֵּי occurs only here in the Bible; its precise meaning is uncertain.",
        "Or “there will be no strong arm or large army when it is pulled up by the roots.”"
      ],
